     <P style="WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; FONT-FAMILY: 'Microsoft YaHei'; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: medium; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial"><STRONG><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">编者按：</SPAN></STRONG></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 32px; FONT-FAMILY: 'Microsoft YaHei'; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: medium; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">鲁家贤先生是绍兴一中</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">1956</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">届校友，著名乡贤、爱乡楷模。从</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">1987</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">年起，鲁先生就在母校设立了</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">鲁家贤奖学金</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">，用于每年奖励品学兼优的学生。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">2019</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">年，鲁先生及其子高央先生又出资</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">3000</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">万元（分</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">5</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">年实施）设立</SPAN><STRONG><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">“</SPAN></SPAN></STRONG><STRONG><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">绍兴一中英贤计划</SPAN></STRONG><STRONG><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">”</SPAN></SPAN></STRONG><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">项目，用于支持母校引进高层次人才、奖励教学业绩优秀的教师团队和高考、竞赛成绩优异的学生，助力母校更好、更优、更有特色发展。其中，</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">英贤学生奖</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">专门奖励每年在高考与竞赛中成绩优异的学生。</SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 32px; FONT-FAMILY: 'Microsoft YaHei'; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: medium; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">2019</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">年度</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">英贤学生奖</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">已经颁发。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">2019</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">届一大批考取一流大学的高三毕业生获此殊荣。拿到沉甸甸的奖金（</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">名校录取</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">分</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">2000</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">元</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">/</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">人、</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">4000</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">元</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">/</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">人两档，</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">“</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">竞赛获奖</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">”</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">分</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">10000</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">元</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">/</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">人、</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">20000</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">元</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-SIZE: 16px"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: Calibri">/</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">人两档），已经在各大著名高校深造的一中学子们纷纷<STRONG>表达了对母校老师、对鲁家贤学长的诚挚感谢和美好祝愿</STRONG>。<STRONG>他们在感言中，诉说一中情怀，分享大学体验，描绘青春梦想，对一中的学弟学妹们很有启发意义。</STRONG></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 32px; FONT-FAMILY: 'Microsoft YaHei'; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: medium; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial"><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">我们分批为大家奉上这些获奖者的感言，<STRONG>既彰英贤，又启来者</STRONG>。</SPAN></P><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 16px">
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042714015530.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>15</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">张洲</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">复旦大学</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">有幸获得英贤奖学金，我首先要感谢鲁家贤学长，感谢母校，也感谢我的班主任老师。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">三年半时光在绍兴一中度过，从云栖到镜湖，这里求真博雅、思想自由、兼容并包的氛围始终延续，这也成为我三年来受益的源泉。这里有优美如画的校园，这里有悉心勠力的师长，这里有志同道合的同学——这里有我难忘的回忆。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">无数关心、支持一中的人推动着一中的发展，而博雅的一中又推动着无数学子成长成才。我希望能与绍兴一中共同进步，也希望学弟学妹们积极奋进，共同书写绍兴一中的崭新篇章。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042714020692.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>10</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">陈龙翀</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">上海财经大学</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">首先，非常感谢鲁家贤老学长，感谢绍兴一中，感谢所有教过我的老师们。能够在高考中取得好成绩，离不开学校良好的学习环境和老师们的辛勤教导。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">在绍兴一中的生活，不仅只是学到了课本的知识，更是学到了很多为人处世的道理。还要感谢同学们的鼓励与支持，在绍兴一中学习的经历，给自己留下了最美好的回忆。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">奖学金对自己来讲，既是一种荣誉，也是对曾经努力的肯定，更是对我今后学习的期许和鼓励。我会时时提醒自己保持认真学习的那种精神，拼搏奋斗，继续向前。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">同时，也希望学弟学妹们能够认真学习，积极拓宽视野加强实践，珍惜在一中的每一分每一秒，努力实现自己的梦想。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042714022065.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>8</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">韩慧瑜</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">香港中文大学（深圳）</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">很高兴能获得英贤奖学金，感谢鲁家贤先生，感谢母校和我的老师们。其实这算是我高中里的第一次拿奖学金（当然，也是最后一次）。我的经历和传统意义上的优秀学生不同，我敢说高二高三阶段我的一些授课老师应该想不到我能考出高考的那个成绩。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">我自己也曾在一些模拟考失利的时候估摸着自己的分数顶天了就是去个“</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>211</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">”大学，但是我确实没有为这种状况担心过，总怀有一种堪称“盲目”的自信，我可以去到一切我喜欢的地方，只要我想就可以努力做到。大概是在第二次选考后才开始印证我的想法吧，希望首考失利的学弟学妹们不要放弃。<B>目标最重要，其次就是认清自己的问题和优点。</B></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">下面是高考后对自身最后冲刺阶段的回顾，聊以作高考岁月的总结和反思：</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">直到现在才开始悔恨自己没有好好学习</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>16</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">天到底补不完高中三年。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">进入一中以后，高手太多，打击太大，自己也曾没有目标没有动力，一直沿用初中那种临时抱佛脚的方法，却忘了高中的知识根本不是靠一点小聪明就能吃透的。果不其然，学考成绩惨淡，</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>6A4B</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">，物化政这种要靠做题记忆的全都不行，连语文都因为语基弱拿不到</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>A</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">。不爱做数学作业，数学成绩起伏特别大，连自己都怀疑自己的能力。一整个高二语文课似乎都在“打酱油”，《论语》是一点都不记得，从《指南录后序》开始的古文都没背下来，语基弱到难以想象；英语甚至是课本后面的必修单词都没背好，从入学的前几位到最差时低于平均分，做个完型都要错四五题，阅读都要错。拖延症重度患者不到考前一晚打死学不进去。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>    </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">直到有了目标才开始有动力。选考倒计时</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>7</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">天，四天做完一本地理，一天半啃下生物课本，却实在没有多少精力对付历史。选考蒙混过关，选考后却又松懈下来，每天坐着听课却没听进去多少，心里很焦虑很烦，试卷一套套买到头来一张都没做，计划一个个写结果却一天都没有实行，每天怀着愧疚和理想入睡，醒来又提不起劲</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">而且还是整天想玩。有自己的复习方法但是作业压力又让开始复习的时间一拖再拖，可其实作业又都做不进去，全是无用功，心思又不全在学习。每次看到同学认真做自己的试卷或者看书复习内心都发慌，一到早读课就烦躁得很，实在是要补的太多无从下手，每次一想到数学就什么都不能想，什么都不愿做，实在是漏洞太多。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>    </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">到高考倒计时</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>16</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">天，才真正静心开始复习。两天半一本三百多页的数学做下来了。论语古诗鉴赏文言文大阅读语用全部重学一遍，看完一遍五三和还有一本忘了叫什么的，加起来超</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>800</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">页。什么作文素材都买却都没时间看，死命记了几个素材每次模考翻来覆去用，当时我的议论文破题的能力已经很弱了，还写出过</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>30</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">分的离题作文，补了一本满分议论文却都只是纸上谈兵，特别怕去年那种又红又专的题目却又没办法，去考场前还背了黄大年、南仁东、敦煌女儿这种素材，很无奈地用到了高考作文里。英语总共只复习了一个晚上和一个上午，鬼知道我是怎么做完紫五三前面</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>105</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">页的语法又刷光语法填空和大半完型，又背光作文三合一的应用文，最后高考前面没扣分，挺满意了，要知道我的最后一次模拟前面我扣了快</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>10</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">分。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN> </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">对于类似三位一体这类综合招生又没有充足准备，全靠一点点临场发挥能力“苟”下来。放弃了很多机会。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">    </SPAN> </FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">总而言之，醒悟太迟。拿自己的人生开玩笑，没有目标还懒得要死。直到找到了自己想要的学校——香港中文大学（深圳），这是支撑我不做咸鱼的动力。我从来不信命，因为我真的不怎么幸运又不怎么努力，实在没这种脸面。但《炼金术士》里说万物会为追求天命的人让路。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>    </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">非常开心能找到目标，让我好歹抓住了一点青春的尾巴，努力了一下。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>16</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">天补不完高中三年，却让我知道我的无限可能。遗憾多多，但遗憾也能让我们将来回忆过往不至无话可说。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>    </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">我愿风雨兼程。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">有志者事竟成，破釜沉舟，百二秦关终属楚。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">苦心者天不负，卧薪尝胆，三千越甲可攻吴。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">与诸君共勉。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042714023331.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>15</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">祝晓斌</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">浙江大学</SPAN></B><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">收到奖学金时，我有些哽咽。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">忙碌于大学课程学习中，我突然发现已经离开母校半年，这笔奖学金带给我的第一件事，居然是对母校的回忆。我难以忘记这笔奖学金背后，老师们的无私奉献，母校的深切关怀。我从高考的战场上凯旋，这份“英贤奖”，是母校和鲁家贤先生对我的肯定，更是他们对我的殷切期盼。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">收下这份沉甸甸的荣誉，我必将不负期望，激流勇进。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">我骄傲我是一中人，我感谢我的一中。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> <IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202004/2020042714024608.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal align=center><B><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>2019</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">届高三</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>15</FONT></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">班</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">王青怡</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">浙江大学</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">这次能拿到英贤奖学金，对我来说，是一个意外的惊喜。首先我要感谢鲁家贤先生，更要感谢绍兴一中对我的栽培，是一中博雅的文化氛围、丰富的学习资源造就了在这里求学的莘莘学子。同时我也要感谢这三年半的时间里每一位教授过我知识的老师，感谢高中时期带给我欢乐、给予我温暖的同学，感谢一直照顾我、支持我的家人们尤其是我妈妈。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">高中三年是我人生中刻骨铭心的一段旅程。这条路并不一帆风顺，但正是路上的坎坷和艰辛让我成长为现在的我。我曾经因为住校时的睡眠问题而临近崩溃，也曾因为同学间的不睦而影响学习。现在回想起来，曾经觉得比天大的事也不过如此。如果能再来一次的话，我会抛开那些纷扰，专心投入学习，不让自己留下遗憾。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">一中是个群英荟萃的学府。在这里，许多曾经很优秀的同学也可能会在激烈的竞争中遭受打击，显得黯淡。在一中的三年半里，我不止一次有过这种体会，觉得自己好像失去了存在感。我很感谢给予过我鼓励的老师们，是他们让我明白：不必在意其他人，只要管好自己，踏踏实实读好书比其他什么都重要。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">最后我想感谢自己——感谢你坚持了下来，你已经比那个在四年前初中毕业时的懵懂女孩所想象的要走得远得多了。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 27px; WIDOWS: 2; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-STYLE: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 32px; FONT-FAMILY: 'Microsoft YaHei'; WHITE-SPACE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); FONT-SIZE: medium; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; WORD-SPACING: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial"></SPAN> </P>
    
    </div><!--endprint-->
